# external benchmark clones (fetch with: git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/practikpharma/PGxCorpus ;
# git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/KarlKeat/PGxQA). The clones carry their own .git, so only
# the derived file written beside them (dataset/pgxqa_eval.jsonl, convert_pgxqa.py) is tracked
dataset/PGxCorpus/
dataset/PGxQA/
# masked KB copies are regenerated by make_masked_recovery.py; only the task files are tracked
dataset/ADR_DataSet_masked/*.tsv
